<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Pediatrix rated buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Pediatrix rated buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- McDonald &amp; Co said analyst Stephen Denelsky initiated coverage of Pediatrix Medical Group Inc with buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Estimated earnings of $1.25 per share for 1997, and $1.60 for 1998.</p>
<p>-- Set 12-month price target of $45.</p>
<p>-- Shares shed 2-5/8 to 32-3/8.</p>
</text>
